      en: ["Elevation of approx. 650 meters above sea level", "Located in the Kayes region of western Mali", "Composed of geologically ancient sandstone", "Home to rare and endemic succulent species", "Historic vantage point of the Mali Empire", "Key watershed situated between Bafing and Bakoy"],
